Shin-Obi-Wan Can-No-Be-Seen was the ultimate tactical liability for his kobold clan. While his hyper-acute ninja instincts made him incredibly aware of his surroundings, his impressively low intellect completely sabotaged team missions, causing him to constantly botch coordination and fail any task requiring basic logical reasoning. Eager to get rid of the lovable doofus, his clan sent him on a "sacred solo quest" to see the world. Naturally, his journey took a bizarre turn when he attempted to sneak up on a group of adventurers to ambush them. Intending to launch a brilliant surprise attack, he successfully sneaked into one of their massive backpacks—and promptly fell fast asleep.
Unknowingly stowing away, he napped through an entire dungeon trek and a magical portal ride back to the Crystal Library. He finally woke up tumbling head-over-tail onto a shop counter, completely startling the merchant as the adventurer dumped out their dungeon loot. He now finds himself stranded in a strange new land...
